      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think i get the coin thing. but u mentioned it's like a \"magical\" bond which sounds a bit weird for a physics class. einstein called it \"spooky action at a distance\"—what did he mean by that exactly? like why did he think it was so problematic?",
